		{
			dependencies: [
				"1FE412A9EE49732A"
				"76D9BFDB2D1CC0D8"
				"7C57A84FCA44E905"
			]
			description: [
				"You can &cautomate the fusion crafting&r with &6PackagedAuto&r."
				""
				"To work, you need to have two block empty between the core and the injector. "
				""
				"You can place 3x3=9 injector for each faces of the core."
				""
				"You can place max 9x6=54 injector (in this pack, you need 27 injector to be able to do all the recipes)"
				""
				"All injectors need some energy to craft."
				""
				"The central item in recipe need to be in the core, and the other items need to be placed in the injectors. "
				""
				"You need one injector for each items present in the craft."
				""
				"There is a button in the core interface to launch the craft if all needed items are present in injectors. "
				""
				"A redstone pulse can launch the craft."
				""
				"There is diferent tier of injector: Draconium -> Wyvern -> Draconic -> Chaotic."
				""
				"You can make recipe that require a lower tier if you have a higher tier. The chaotic injector can make all the recipes; the draconic can't make chaotic tier recipes; wyvern can't make the chaotic and draconic tier recipes; draconium can only make draconium tier recipes"
			]
			icon: "draconicevolution:crafting_core"
