			description: [
				"You can use &cpipez&r with &emekanism multiblock&r in this pack. "
				""
				"The pipe will keep is state even if multiblock is broken."
				""
				"You can &4instant fill&r any &6Mekanism tank&r with an &3Evertide Amulet&r. "
				""
				"You can use a &aDynamic Tank&r to have enouth &1water&r for your &dreactor&r."
