		{
			dependencies: [
				"28E19FFDA8264278"
				"1BD9790611BC7500"
			]
			description: [
				"This multiblock consume an insane quantity of water to cool himself. You will need to pump a lot of water in your reactor. "
				""
				"If you don't cool it correctly, it will break. If the reactor break, some block of the multiblock will be destroyed, and radiation will kill you around the reactor. "
				""
				"You can remove the radiation and heal you with the quests rewards at the begening of the chapter. "
				""
				"The hazmat armor can protect you from radiation. The meka suit can also protect you if you installed the radiation shielding unit on all the part of your armor."
				""
				"You can ajust the burnrate of your reactor to burn faster your fissile fuel and producing more nuclear waste. But be careful, more the burnrate is high, more it consume water. And if you burn too much fuel, the temperature will be too high, the water won't cool correctly your reactor, then the reactor will take damage, and the reactor will break if there is more than 100% of damage. For exemple, a 9x9x15 reactor with 300 fuel assembly rod can burn around 230mb/t before taking damage, even if he is full of water."
				""
				"There is a ResourcePack in the pack you can use to have mekanism connected textures. "
				""
				"If you don't know how to build mekanism multiblocks, check on wiki or on a video."
				""
				"You can search 'fission reactor mekanism' on google to find the wiki"
			]
